{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Emotica: Understand Emotions 是一款結合情緒簽到、心情手帳與 AI 對話的身心健康 App，適合想更瞭解自身情緒、建立每日反思習慣的用戶。原價 US $79.99 的終生版內購現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，把握機會即可長期使用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-89.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>情緒雲朵與引導冥想</h2>\n<p>Emotica 把情緒日記、AI 教練與引導冥想收進同一空間。每次簽到可挑選當下感受並標示強度，記錄工作或睡眠的影響，再以文字、相片或語音補充。情緒會化成漂浮雲朵，讓你回看心情起伏；亦可與 AI 教練對談梳理思緒。內置呼吸練習、睡前聲音與趨勢分析，助你養成反思習慣。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-530-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-531-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-532-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-533-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-534-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-535-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Emotica: Understand Emotions 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Emotica: Understand Emotions</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/emotica-your-emotions/id6757162931\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.680833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":458,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:14:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T21:38:10.865156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:26.131934+00:00","content_hash":"a6778bf6b91c654b5d600aa87040bc18acaafe06905ad42bff1e144ddb9f55ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.680833+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}